WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.250
In this example there are 100 compute chips.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:10.150
There are memory sets for 60 GPUs.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:16.000
Sixty GPUs are assembled and 40 chips wait.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:21.250
Now there are 40 compute chips.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.150
There are still memory sets for 60 GPUs.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:32.000
Forty GPUs are assembled. Twenty memory sets remain.
